### Generate 10 Camera parts

### 1. Add Samsung Galaxy S23 Ultra Main Camera (Phone)
POST {{host}}{{part_mapping}}/parts
Authorization: Bearer {{staff_auth_token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="price"

4500.00
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="quantity"

15
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

Samsung Galaxy S23 Ultra 200MP Main Camera Module
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="specifications"

200 MP, f/1.7, 24mm (wide), multi-directional PDAF, Laser AF, OIS
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="manufacturerId"

1
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="deviceTypeId"

3
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="partTypeId"

4
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="deviceModels"

SM-S918B,SM-S918U
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="partImage"; filename="camera01.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./assets/part_image/camera01.jpg

--WebAppBoundary--

